  "descriptions": {
		"english": "Qualifying event for the 2019 F1® Esports Series. Can Lewis HAMILTON take the chequered flag in the 2018 FORMULA 1 AZERBAIJAN GRAND PRIX? This is a points based event. Points will be awarded based on skill, speed, difficulty and assist settings, with additional points awarded for clean racing. For more details please refer to: https://f1esports.com/",
		"english-us" : "Qualifying event for the 2019 F1® Esports Series. Can Lewis HAMILTON take the cheuqered flag in the 2018 FORMULA 1 AZERBAIJAN GRAND PRIX? This is a points based event. Points will be awarded based on skill, speed, difficulty and assist settings, with additional points awarded for clean racing. For more details please refer to: https://f1esports.com/",
		"french" : "Épreuve de qualification pour la Série Esports de F1® 2019. Lewis Hamilton peut-il décrocher la victoire au Grand Prix d'Azerbaïdjan 2018 ? Le classement se décide aux points. Points obtenus via dextérité, vitesse, difficulté et aides utilisées. Des points supp. sont octroyés en cas de conduite propre. Pour en savoir plus, consultez : https://f1esports.com/",
		"italian" : "Evento Qualifiche per l'Esports Series 2019 F1®. Riuscirà Lewis HAMILTON a tagliare il traguardo per primo nel 2018 FORMULA 1 AZERBAIJAN GRAND PRIX? Questo è un evento a punti. I punti saranno assegnati sulla base delle impostazioni di abilità, velocità, difficoltà e aiuti, con punti supplementari per la correttezza in gara. Per maggiori dettagli: https://f1esports.com/",
		"german" : "Qualifikationsevent für die 2019 F1® Esports Series. Kann Lewis HAMILTON sich beim 2018 FORMULA 1 AZERBAIJAN GRAND PRIX die karierte Flagge holen? Die vergebenen Punkte basieren auf Fahrkönnen, Geschwindigkeit, Schwierigkeitsgrad und Fahrhilfen; ein sauberes Rennen bringt zusätzliche Punkte ein. Mehr Infos unter https://f1esports.com",
		"spanish" : "Clasificación para Esports Series de F1® 2019. ¿Puede Lewis HAMILTON conquistar la bandera a cuadros en el 2018 FORMULA 1 AZERBAIJAN GRAND PRIX? Es un evento por puntos. Se otorgarán más o menos según los ajustes de habilidad, velocidad, dificultad y asistencia.Las carreras limpias brindan puntos adicionales. Para saber más, ve a: https://f1esports.com/",
		"japanese" : "F1® Eスポーツシリーズ予選。ルイス・ハミルトンは2018年フォーミュラ1アゼルバイジャン・グランプリでチェッカーフラッグを揺らすことができるか？ポイントベースで競われるこのイベントでは、スキル、スピード、難易度、アシスト設定に基づくポイントに加え、クリーンレースで追加ポイントが加算される。詳細はこちら: https://f1esports.com/",
		"tchinese" : "Qualifying event for the 2019 F1® Esports Series. Can Lewis HAMILTON take the cheuqered flag in the 2018 FORMULA 1 AZERBAIJAN GRAND PRIX? This is a points based event. Points will be awarded based on skill, speed, difficulty and assist settings, with additional points awarded for clean racing. For more details please refer to: https://f1esports.com/",
		"schinese" : "2019F1®电子竞技系列赛的资格赛。L·汉密尔顿可以在2018年FORMULA 1阿塞拜疆大奖赛中获得方格旗吗？本次赛事是积分赛。依照车手技术、速度、赛事难度和辅助设置来给分，完美比赛更可额外获得积分。如需详细信息，请查看：https://f1esports.com/",
		"russian" : "Квалификационный заезд серии F1® Esports 2019. Сумеет ли Льюис ХЭМИЛТОН забрать клетчатый флаг «ФОРМУЛЫ-1» на ГРАН-ПРИ АЗЕРБАЙДЖАНА 2018? В этом событии пилоты зарабатывают очки за мастерство. Результаты заезда определяются очками, начисляемыми за мастерство, скорость, сложность и настройки помощи, а также за чистую езду. Дополнительную информацию можно найти на https://f1esports.com/",
		"polish" : "Wydarzenie kwalifikacyjne eSports Series F1® 2019. Czy Lewis HAMILTON sięgnie po zwycięstwo w wyścigu FORMUŁY 1 GRAND PRIX AZERBEJDŻANU 2018? To jest wydarzenie z punktacją. Punkty zostaną przyznane za umiejętności, prędkość i ustawienia systemów wspomagania, a dodatkowe punkty można zdobyć za jazdę bez kolizji. Szczegóły pod adresem: https://f1esports.com/",
		"portuguese" : "Qualifying event for the 2019 F1® Esports Series. Can Lewis HAMILTON take the cheuqered flag in the 2018 FORMULA 1 AZERBAIJAN GRAND PRIX? This is a points based event. Points will be awarded based on skill, speed, difficulty and assist settings, with additional points awarded for clean racing. For more details please refer to: https://f1esports.com/",
		"brazilian" : "Evento de classificação para a Série E-Sports 2019 da F1®. Lewis HAMILTON conseguirá a bandeira quadriculada no GRANDE PRÊMIO DO AZERBAIJÃO DE FÓRMULA 1 DE 2018? Este evento é baseado em pontos, concedidos com base em habilidade, velocidade, dificuldade e configurações de assistência e pontos adicionais por uma corrida limpa. Para saber mais, visite: https://f1esports.com/",
		"french-ca" : "Épreuve de qualification pour la Série Esports de F1® 2019. Lewis Hamilton peut-il décrocher la victoire au Grand Prix d'Azerbaïdjan 2018 ? Le classement se décide aux points. Points obtenus via dextérité, vitesse, difficulté et aides utilisées. Des points supp. sont octroyés en cas de conduite propre. Pour en savoir plus, consultez : https://f1esports.com/",
		"spanish-us" : "Clasificación para Esports Series de F1® 2019. ¿Puede Lewis HAMILTON conquistar la bandera a cuadros en el 2018 FORMULA 1 AZERBAIJAN GRAND PRIX? Es un evento por puntos. Se otorgarán más o menos según los ajustes de habilidad, velocidad, dificultad y asistencia.Las carreras limpias brindan puntos adicionales. Para saber más, ve a: https://f1esports.com/",
		"worstcase" : "Qualifying event for the 2019 F1® Esports Series. Can Lewis HAMILTON take the cheuqered flag in the 2018 FORMULA 1 AZERBAIJAN GRAND PRIX? This is a points based event. Points will be awarded based on skill, speed, difficulty and assist settings, with additional points awarded for clean racing. For more details please refer to: https://f1esports.com/"		
